2026-07-27T13:43:27.8836871Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T13:43:27.8837666Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T13:43:27.8838104Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T13:43:27.8838756Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T13:43:27.8839859Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T13:43:27.8840740Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
